messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_fax3.c
Line: 1616
Function: Fax4Decode
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: Uses occ % sp->b.rowbytes without ensuring sp->b.rowbytes != 0. If rowbytes (bytes per output row) is 0 (e.g., from a zero-width image), this triggers a division by zero before any further checks.

Source context:
```c
